{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These are "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"core"}]},{"type":"text","value":" options and API properties for all cells. More options and API properties are available for other "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guide/features.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"table features"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"cell-api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cell API"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All cell objects have the following properties:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"id","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"}]},{"type":"code","value":"id: string","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The unique ID for the cell across the entire table."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getvalue","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getValue"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getValue: () => any","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns the value for the cell, accessed via the associated column's accessor key or accessor function."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"rendervalue","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderValue"}]},{"type":"code","value":"renderValue: () => any","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Renders the value for a cell the same as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getValue"},{"type":"text","value":", but will return the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderFallbackValue"},{"type":"text","value":" if no value is found."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"row","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"row"}]},{"type":"code","value":"row: Row<TData>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The associated Row object for the cell."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"column","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"column"}]},{"type":"code","value":"column: Column<TData>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The associated Column object for the cell."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getcontext","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getContext"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getContext: () => {\n  table: Table<TData>\n  column: Column<TData, TValue>\n  row: Row<TData>\n  cell: Cell<TData, TValue>\n  getValue: <TTValue = TValue,>() => TTValue\n  renderValue: <TTValue = TValue,>() => TTValue | null\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns the rendering context (or props) for cell-based components like cells and aggregated cells. Use these props with your framework's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"flexRender"},{"type":"text","value":" utility to render these using the template of your choice:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"cell-api","text":"Cell API","level":2},{"id":"id","text":"id","level":3},{"id":"getvalue","text":"getValue","level":3},{"id":"rendervalue","text":"renderValue","level":3},{"id":"row","text":"row","level":3},{"id":"column","text":"column","level":3},{"id":"getcontext","text":"getContext","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThese are **core** options and API properties for all cells. More options and API properties are available for other [table features](../../guide/features.md).\n\n## Cell API\n\nAll cell objects have the following properties:\n\n### `id`\n\n```tsx\nid: string\n```\n\nThe unique ID for the cell across the entire table.\n\n### `getValue`\n\n```tsx\ngetValue: () => any\n```\n\nReturns the value for the cell, accessed via the associated column's accessor key or accessor function.\n\n### `renderValue`\n\n```tsx\nrenderValue: () => any\n```\n\nRenders the value for a cell the same as `getValue`, but will return the `renderFallbackValue` if no value is found.\n\n### `row`\n\n```tsx\nrow: Row<TData>\n```\n\nThe associated Row object for the cell.\n\n### `column`\n\n```tsx\ncolumn: Column<TData>\n```\n\nThe associated Column object for the cell.\n\n### `getContext`\n\n```tsx\ngetContext: () => {\n  table: Table<TData>\n  column: Column<TData, TValue>\n  row: Row<TData>\n  cell: Cell<TData, TValue>\n  getValue: <TTValue = TValue,>() => TTValue\n  renderValue: <TTValue = TValue,>() => TTValue | null\n}\n```\n\nReturns the rendering context (or props) for cell-based components like cells and aggregated cells. Use these props with your framework's `flexRender` utility to render these using the template of your choice:\n\n```tsx\nflexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Cell APIs\n---\n\nThese are **core** options and API properties for all cells. More options and API properties are available for other [table features](../../guide/features.md).\n\n## Cell API\n\nAll cell objects have the following properties:\n\n### `id`\n\n```tsx\nid: string\n```\n\nThe unique ID for the cell across the entire table.\n\n### `getValue`\n\n```tsx\ngetValue: () => any\n```\n\nReturns the value for the cell, accessed via the associated column's accessor key or accessor function.\n\n### `renderValue`\n\n```tsx\nrenderValue: () => any\n```\n\nRenders the value for a cell the same as `getValue`, but will return the `renderFallbackValue` if no value is found.\n\n### `row`\n\n```tsx\nrow: Row<TData>\n```\n\nThe associated Row object for the cell.\n\n### `column`\n\n```tsx\ncolumn: Column<TData>\n```\n\nThe associated Column object for the cell.\n\n### `getContext`\n\n```tsx\ngetContext: () => {\n  table: Table<TData>\n  column: Column<TData, TValue>\n  row: Row<TData>\n  cell: Cell<TData, TValue>\n  getValue: <TTValue = TValue,>() => TTValue\n  renderValue: <TTValue = TValue,>() => TTValue | null\n}\n```\n\nReturns the rendering context (or props) for cell-based components like cells and aggregated cells. Use these props with your framework's `flexRender` utility to render these using the template of your choice:\n\n```tsx\nflexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())\n```\n"}
